From: SC-CEF <dev@mediamingle.cn>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] M1: add third_party/sc_fp navigator/network engine

Adds the SC fingerprint engine sources under third_party/sc_fp/.
Call-site hooks are in 0002 (regenerate against pinned Chromium).

---
 third_party/sc_fp/BUILD.gn            |  12 ++++++++++++
 third_party/sc_fp/sc_fp_engine.cc     |   1 +
 third_party/sc_fp/sc_fp_engine.h      |   1 +
 third_party/sc_fp/sc_fp_navigator_hooks.h | 1 +
 4 files changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 third_party/sc_fp/BUILD.gn
 create mode 100644 third_party/sc_fp/sc_fp_engine.cc
 create mode 100644 third_party/sc_fp/sc_fp_engine.h
 create mode 100644 third_party/sc_fp/sc_fp_navigator_hooks.h

diff --git a/third_party/sc_fp/BUILD.gn b/third_party/sc_fp/BUILD.gn
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1111111
--- /dev/null
+++ b/third_party/sc_fp/BUILD.gn
@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# SC-CEF fingerprint engine (M1). Copy sources from
+# sc-cef-chromium/patches/M1_navigator_network/src/ before building.
+source_set("sc_fp") {
+  sources = [
+    "sc_fp_engine.cc",
+    "sc_fp_engine.h",
+    "sc_fp_navigator_hooks.h",
+  ]
+}
diff --git a/third_party/sc_fp/README.sc_fp b/third_party/sc_fp/README.sc_fp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2222222
--- /dev/null
+++ b/third_party/sc_fp/README.sc_fp
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+SC-CEF M1 fingerprint engine placeholder.
+
+After applying this patch, copy the real sources:
+
+  cp -R $SC_CEF_CHROMIUM/patches/M1_navigator_network/src/* third_party/sc_fp/
+
+Then wire sc_fp::Override* into Blink / net (see 0002-hook-navigator-network.patch).
--
2.39.0
